iki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stylesheet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"resourceCounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"third-party\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"resourceType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"script\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预算失败的处理流程\">预算失败的处理流程</h2><p>预算检查失败不应只是一行红色 CI 日志——需要提供足够的上下文帮助开发者快速修复：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[预算检查失败] --&gt; B[生成对比报告]&#10;    B --&gt; C[标注退化项&lt;br/&gt;与基线值的 delta]&#10;    C --&gt; D{退化幅度}&#10;    D --&gt;|轻微 &lt; 10%| E[Warning&lt;br/&gt;允许合并但标记]&#10;    D --&gt;|显著 &gt; 10%| F[Error&lt;br/&gt;阻断合并]&#10;    F --&gt; G[提供优化建议&lt;br/&gt;Lighthouse 诊断]&#10;    G --&gt; H[标注责任文件&lt;br/&gt;哪个 chunk 变大了]\">graph TD\n    A[预算检查失败] --&gt; B[生成对比报告]\n    B --&gt; C[标注退化项&lt;br/&gt;与基线值的 delta]\n    C --&gt; D{退化幅度}\n    D --&gt;|轻微 &lt; 10%| E[Warning&lt;br/&gt;允许合并但标记]\n    D --&gt;|显著 &gt; 10%| F[Error&lt;br/&gt;阻断合并]\n    F --&gt; G[提供优化建议&lt;br/&gt;Lighthouse 诊断]\n    G --&gt; H[标注责任文件&lt;br/&gt;哪个 chunk 变大了]</pre><p>最佳实践是将预算报告直接评论到 PR 中，包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>当前值 vs 预算阈值 vs 历史基线</li>\n<li>体积变化的具体文件列表（通过 bundle analyzer）</li>\n<li>Lighthouse 给出的 opportunity/diagnostic 建议</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>性能预算将性能守护从事后补救转变为 CI 级别的自动门控</li>\n<li>Lighthouse CI 支持时间/体积/数量/分数四类预算的自动化检查</li>\n<li>Bundle size 预算是性能的领先指标，应在构建阶段即检查</li>\n<li>预算值应基于竞品基线 + CWV 阈值制定，渐进收紧</li>\n<li>失败报告应提供对比、delta、责任文件和优化建议</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"alerting-regression-detection\">告警与回归检测</a>——预算守护的上线后续：生产环境的回归发现机制</li>\n<li><a href=\"../web-performance-vitals/delivery/perf-budget-ci\">Web 性能优化 — 性能预算与 CI</a>——从优化角度看预算如何驱动持续改进</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能预算与 CI 集成","id":"性能预算与-ci-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Lighthouse CI 完整配置","id":"lighthouse-ci-完整配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Bundle Size 预算自动化","id":"bundle-size-预算自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"预算制定策略","id":"预算制定策略"},{"level":2,"text":"预算失败的处理流程","id":"预算失败的处理流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能调试工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/analysis/performance-debugging-workflow"},"next":{"title":"告警与回归检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/alerting-regression-detection"}}